 s for a high-impact\, one-hour online meeting. \n\nRegister: https://us02
 web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZAsd-2rqj8uH9y5XVDlgrI908afhZZ1qNNN#/regist
 ration\n\nMore about Blue Devil Toastmasters: https://bluedevil.toastmast
