DESCRIPTION:The Pharmacology and Cancer Biology Works in Progress (WIP) se
 ries is held on Fridays at 12:00 noon. This series gives our trainees an 
 opportunity to present their work orally and obtain feedback.\n\nBen Lau 
 (Greg Wang Lab): A role for RNA binding in promoting the non-canonical fu
 nctions of EZH2 in cancer\n\nTuyana Malankhanova\, PhD (West Lab): LRRK2 
 Activity Contributes to Lysosomal Swelling
